          "short": "$(6x+5)(3x+2)$",
          "worked": "$P=180$, $S=27$, $F=12,15$.\n$$\\begin{align*}18x^{2}+27x+10&=18x^{2}+12x+15x+10\\\\&=6x(3x+2)+5(3x+2)\\\\&=(6x+5)(3x+2)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
